# Blog Post
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Blog — a published post, readable by anyone, written by an authenticated Author
# Case 13 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: blog-comment.menata
#
# THE NEW FINDING THIS CASE EXISTS TO SURFACE: every case since Case 1 has assumed
# every viewer is an authenticated workspace member with a role. A public blog's
# Published Posts must be readable with NO login at all — "Visitor" below is not a
# workspace role, it is the absence of one.

Post

Fields

- Title : Text
- Slug : Text
- Body : Rich Text
- Author : User
- Status : Draft | Published
- Published At : Date
- Tags : Text

Constraints

- Title is required.
- Slug is required.
- Body is required.

Permissions

Author

- Write
- Publish

Visitor

- Read Published

Views

- Post Form : Form
- Published Posts : List
- Post Detail : Detail
